# The build context is the repository root, so everything large and irrelevant
# has to be named here, or it is shipped to the builder before the first
# instruction runs. `result` is what `nix build` leaves behind.
result
.git
.github
docs
/build
# The compose credentials. The build stage copies the whole context, so they
# would otherwise sit in its layers and the build cache.
compose/.env
compose/.env.tmp
